  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2806.01 Permit-By-Notification Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2806.01 Permit-By-Notification Required. Prior to operating any non-metallic mineral processing plant, the owner or operator shall obtain:\n\n(a) A standard permit, as specified in Env-A 600; or\n\n(b) A permit-by-notification, as specified in this part.\n\nSource. #9793, eff 10-1-10; ss by #12693, eff 12-22-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2800.html"
